  "body": "### Changed\r\n\r\n- **Windows MXC backend:** `@microsoft/mxc-sdk` is now an optional peer dependency. npm users of `windows.backend: 'mxc'` must install it themselves or pass `windowsMxcSdk`. (#822)\r\n\r\n### New\r\n\r\n- **Windows MXC backend:** `initialize()` accepts `windowsMxcSdk`, so an embedding program can supply its own MXC SDK. The `MxcSdk` types are exported. (#820)\r\n- **Windows MXC backend:** `spawnSandboxed()` accepts `env` for the child process. (#822)"
